  "description": "Enoch is a priest that has lost the love of his life. One day, he comes across a familiar face in the church where he preaches. The man, also called Ray like his beloved, pursues him posing as his late lover and Enoch decides to go along with his ruse. Will Enoch be able to resist temptation? Or will he end up making a pact with the devil? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
